  npcName: Luke
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 879771316d3537d4b8a631d56dd98ff2, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - Hey Justin. Sorry for calling you this early. Are you still coming to Valdoria
    today?
  - "Do you think you could get here a little sooner? I\u2019ve been trying to reach
    your sister, but she hasn\u2019t been answering her phone."
  - "Not that long. She\u2019s probably just busy, but I was supposed to meet her
    and I haven\u2019t heard back."
  - Thanks. Call me when you get to San Paloma.
